{"ancestors": "0,9028541,9028551", "bizKey": "9028552", "createBy": null, "createTime": "2024-06-05 19:54:37", "detail": "<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 14px;\"><strong>苹果结构件介绍：</strong></span></p><p><br></p><p><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 14px;\">苹果手机结构件是指构成苹果手机框架和支撑其内部组件的各种部件。‌这些结构件包括但不限于手机的外壳、‌中框、‌支架等，‌它们共同构成了手机的整体结构和形状，‌为内部电子元件提供支撑和保护。‌结构件的设计和制造对于手机的整体性能、‌耐用性和用户体验至关重要。‌</span></p>", "firstLetter": "JGJ", "imgUrl": null, "importance": 2, "level": 3, "limitUpTimes": 0, "name": "结构件", "parentId": 9028551, "pctChg": 0.85, "reason": "结构件", "remark": "", "sort": 1, "status": "1", "subjectId": 9028552, "type": 1, "updateBy": null, "updateTime": "2024-07-09 09:48:52"}
